<div class="body">
  <p>Hi {{name}},</p>

  <p>Welcome to Finishi! Your account is all set and you're ready to start learning.</p>

  <p>
    Finishi breaks down complex topics into bite-sized, goal-driven lessons so you can
    make real progress — at your own pace.
  </p>

  {{#if skill}}
  <p>
    We've set up a personalised path around <span class="badge">{{skill}}</span>
    so your first lesson is already waiting.
  </p>
  {{/if}}

  <div class="cta-wrap">
    <a class="cta" href="{{ctaUrl}}">Start Learning</a>
  </div>

  <hr class="divider" />

  <p>Have questions? Just reply to this email — we read every one.</p>
</div>
